 ## Delivery
 
 `estimateDelivery(orderedAt, transitDays)` returns the expected delivery date in Istanbul time.
+
+Orders placed before 15:00 Istanbul time on a weekday ship the same day. Orders placed later, or at the weekend, ship on the next weekday. Delivery is `transitDays` weekdays after shipping. The result is the same whatever time zone the server runs in.
